WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
Vhidhiyo iyi inopa sumo pfupi kumudziyo weArclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Batidza uchishandisa bhatani regrey iri.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Pakutanga, migumo yese yeArclight inogona kuuya panguva imwe chete.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Kana rikasabatika zvachose kana kuti mwenje usina kujeka, bhatiri rinogona kunge rakati sandara.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Batanidza mukati uchishandisa USB charger.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Pakuchaja, maraiti egirinhi achauya.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Mushure memaminitsi gumi nemashanu, inofanira kubhadharwa zvakakwana uye kushanda kwemaawa akawanda.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Kuisiya muchiedza chezuva kunoita kuti bhatiri rirambe rakachajwa.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Iwe hauzodi kutsiva chero mabhatiri kana magirobhu.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
Iyo modhi kana magumo ese ari maviri auya ndeyekushandisa zvakajairika.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Chinja kuita ziso modhi nekubata bhatani pasi kwemasekonzi gumi nemashanu.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Zvadaro simudza zvigunwe zvako uye nekukurumidza kudzvanya zvakare sezvo chiedza chinopenya.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Iwe zvino wave mune yeziso mode, uko iyo ophthalmoscope ichauya

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
kutanga, ipapo anterior segment loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Kudzokorora nhanho idzi kunotenderera nenzira nhatu dzakasiyana dzekushandisa.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
General kushandiswa, maziso, ipapo nzeve.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Paunenge uchinge wasarudza yaunoda modhi, uchidzvanya bhatani regrey

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
inoshandura kuti mwenje unopenya sei uye kuti ndeupi magumo anovhenekera.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Ita shuwa kuti washandisa magumo echokwadi pabvunzo chaiyo.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
Ziso rekunze rinoongororwa nekushandisa loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
Maonero acho achave akajeka kana iwe uri pedyo zvikuru neziso kumativi anenge 6 cm.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
Iyo fundal reflex inoitwa pakureba kweruoko uchishandisa yakananga ophthalmoscope.

23
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.740
Kana maonero akasvibiswa, saka tarisa kuti lens rack iri kumusoro.

24
00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.540
Munzvimbo iyi, hapana lens mugomba rekuona uye reflex inofanira kujeka.

25
00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.180
Iyo Arclight inogona zvakare kushandiswa kutora vhidhiyo yezviratidzo zvekiriniki

26
00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:53.760
kana yabatanidzwa nekamera yenharembozha.

27
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.810
Kana yangobatanidzwa, gomba rekuona reiyo ophthalmoscope yakananga

28
00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:05.920
ichaiswa zvakananga pamusoro pepakati pe lens iyo nharembozha yako inoshandisa muvhidhiyo modhi.

29
00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:11.800
Iyo kamera ichashanda semeso ako paunenge uchitarisa nepaburi rekuona.

30
00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.720
Kusimbisa lens yekumisa nayo gomba rekuona,

31
00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:21.760
vhura iyo vhidhiyo app pafoni yako, isa chigunwe chako pane imwe neimwe lenzi.

32
00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:27.100
Kana iyo skrini yasviba, iwe wakavhara lenzi inoshandiswa pavhidhiyo.

33
00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.960
Bvisa bepa reyero kubva kumashure kweklipu.

34
00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:38.180
Isa mapoinzi emuseve pamusoro pepakati pe lens inoshandiswa kutora vhidhiyo.

35
00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.040
Dzvanya clip pasi zvakasimba.

36
00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.150
Bvisa museve.

37
00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:47.410
Iyo clip inofanirwa kunge iri munzvimbo chaiyo.

38
00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:51.470
Kuti uite vhidhiyo reflex, chinja pane yakananga ophthalmoscope

39
00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:56.770
magumo eArclight uye sarudza chiedza chakajeka nekudzvanya katatu.

40
00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.310
Ita shuwa kuti lens rack iri kumusoro.

41
00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.820
Nechiedza chakatarisa kure nefoni kumurwere,

42
00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:09.840
isa iyo Arclight mu clip uye dhonza elastic pamusoro kuti ichengetedze.

43
00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.840
Sunda iyo Arclight kumusoro kusvika isingakwanise kutsvedza zvakare.

44
00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.380
Gomba rekuona kweiyo yakananga ophthalmoscope

45
00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:23.560
ikozvino ichave yakananga pamusoro pepakati lenzi inotora vhidhiyo.

46
00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:28.460
Kunyora ziso rekunze, shandisa imwe mugumo wemudziyo.

47
00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:34.160
Kutora mifananidzo, vhura iyo vhidhiyo app uye zoom mukati,

48
00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.020
kuzadza skrini nekuona kuburikidza neburi rekuona.

49
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.000
Dzvanya rekodhi uye ita bvunzo.

50
00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.220
Dzvanya mira uye chengetedza vhidhiyo.

51
00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.200
Iwe unogona ikozvino kugovana nevamwe vaunoshanda navo pamapuratifomu akachengeteka, akavharidzirwa

52
00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:53.260
chete nechinangwa chawakawana mvumo kubva kumurwere.

53
00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.890
Nakidzwa nekushandisa iyo Arclight mubasa rako.
